{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_cutter_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_cutter_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "速食食品",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cutter_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "83f49f73c5092aeacd6a251f6c0c59e84d12b48026f675b9b7b1edff847a7677",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有人說，雇傭兵就像速食食品一樣。\n開袋即食，用之即棄。高效率，低風險，在戰場上是最好用的消耗品。\n只是，如果有選擇的話，任誰都會更願意吃溫熱新鮮的食物，任誰都不會願意冒著丟掉性命的風險去掙買食物的錢。\n如果有選擇的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_battlefield"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各單位注意，目標已經進入警戒範圍，預計還有一分鐘到達防禦點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請各單位於三十秒內完成應急準備，重複一遍，三十秒內完成應急準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完畢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，我來看看有沒有什麼需要幫忙的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，是刻刀呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來得正好，嘗嘗我做的蔬菜烤餅，剛出爐的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，我嘗嘗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我覺得很好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，這可是我的拿手好菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喜歡的話就多拿幾個吧，不用客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，謝謝，還是不用了。我只是來看看，有沒有我可以幫忙的事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？可是我這裡的菜都已經準備得差不多了呢，你去角峰那邊看看吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，是刻刀小姐啊，來得正好，嘗嘗這道謝拉格風味燴獸肉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了方便取材，我用鱗蜥肉代替了原來的配方，調味也相應地做了點改動，正想找人幫我嘗嘗呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好的，我來試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咀嚼咀嚼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好吃。雖然說不上為什麼......但就是很好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不上為什麼好吃啊......嗯，看來是不夠有特色，還需要改進啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的，只是我不太會描述......我認為角峰先生的廚藝已經非常好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說，角峰先生這裡有什麼需要幫忙的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，我這裡沒什麼需要幫忙的啦，菜都已經上鍋，就剩關火了。你一會去古米那裡看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊對了，還請稍等，有一件事確實需要刻刀小姐的幫忙。我今天試做了好幾道新菜，就麻煩刻刀小姐幫我把把關了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀姐姐！嘗嘗古米烤的餡餅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快要吃飽了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米這裡有什麼需要幫忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米這裡只有烤好的餡餅哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，我就嘗一個好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吃嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該是......好吃的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......吃不下了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明只是想來幫忙，怎麼變成來提前解決午飯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實大家都很照顧我呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來幫忙啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，鑄鐵你可來了。快來幫幫忙吧，今天有兩個後勤幹員同時請假了，只靠我們三個可真是忙不過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拼盡全力倒也能夠完成，可也實在是太勉強了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古米的手好酸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是辛苦啦，我這就來幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，我剛在食堂裡看到刻刀了，看起來好像很失落的樣子，發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來鑄鐵不是經常來廚房，所以還不知道啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個月前"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家好，辛苦了......請問有什麼我可以幫忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔喔，是新來的刻刀小姐啊，正好，麻煩你把那邊的馬鈴薯切成塊好了，一會燉湯用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀小姐！我是讓你把馬鈴薯切塊不是讓你把砧板切塊啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是故意的，我會賠償的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了算了，倒也不用......我明白了，刻刀小姐是不習慣用這種菜刀吧。那麻煩你去盯著那鍋湯好了，記得多用勺子攪拌一下，別燒焦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了，我一定會做好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攪拌，攪拌，不能煮糊，攪拌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攪拌，攪拌......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "後勤幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗅）什麼味道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴行",
      "speakerId": "char_230_savage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然看到刻刀失落的樣子也會於心不忍，但是，作為羅德島廚房的一員，絕對不能允許那種可怕的事情再次發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古米",
      "speakerId": "char_196_sunbr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後勤姐姐之前很認真地考慮過要在“小刻禁止入內”的標誌旁邊加上“刻刀禁止入內”的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必要的損失，還是儘量避免為好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕對不可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀！站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎？鑄鐵小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕對不可以半途而廢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣真的不會給大家添麻煩嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，現在離晚飯時間還早，肯定來得及收拾完的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的是，非常感謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用客氣。我只是覺得，既然有想要嘗試的事，就一定要堅持到底才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，從今天開始，我要對你進行烹飪技能的特訓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，有我在，絕對不會讓之前的事故重演的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定會努力的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您，鑄鐵小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在訓練中要叫我教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈哈，原來被稱為教官是這種感覺啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，教官提問！你覺得烹飪是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把食物弄熟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錯！大錯特錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烹飪可不是把食材弄熟這麼簡單。記好了，烹飪指的是，根據食材的特性，把食物變得美味可口的手段！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我記住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來刻刀是完全沒有基礎呢，那我們就要從最基本的訓練開始了。聽我命令，立正！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，是做任何菜餚都需要用到的，也是最基本的技術——刀工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽我的口令，拿刀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是——左手還是右手......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，用慣用手就好......然後用另一隻手握住這顆馬鈴薯。像我這樣，用刀沿著馬鈴薯的輪廓，輕輕削去這層皮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沿著輪廓......輕輕......削飛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀小姐應該很擅長用刀才對啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "砍菜和砍敵人的手感完全不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然的確如此啦......但食材可不是敵人呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說，任何技能都有一個熟能生巧的過程。我們繼續練習吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑄鐵小姐好厲害，我從來不敢想像，馬鈴薯泥也可以這麼好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，畢竟不能浪費食物嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那麼多馬鈴薯切成那樣，我也著實想不到別的處理方法了啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實烹飪也沒有那麼難啦。你看，只要熟悉了菜刀，你現在不是也可以很熟練地給馬鈴薯削皮了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果等著下鍋的時候又差點把鍋燒穿了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀你還是太緊張啦，烹飪和刀術可不一樣，你不能指望像完成任務那樣，模仿老師的每個動作就能學會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烹飪啊，是要在瞭解食材的特點後，滿懷希望地把食材做成自己期待的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對！重點是心懷希望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像很有道理，嗯，我記住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，刻刀小姐為什麼想要學習廚藝呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的食堂裡的菜式品類很多，喜歡什麼口味應該都可以找到的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為，從來沒有吃過速食食品之外的食物，所以很想試試，親手做出可以吃的東西是什麼樣的感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎也不能說“從來沒有”，只是從記事起就一直跟著師父，師父又是不會做飯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再後來，成為雇傭兵之後，就更沒有機會坐下來安穩吃一頓飯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曾經非常好奇食物到底是怎麼做出來的，就溜去酒館的後廚裡看了看，結果被老闆當作小偷抓住了，之後被狠狠罵了一頓，哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！在！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一定會教會你做菜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算再用十個馬鈴薯，不，就算再用上百個馬鈴薯，我也一定要教會你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，鑄鐵小姐還請冷靜一點，畢竟都是過去的事了，你看，我還是健康地活下來了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解決掉這些馬鈴薯泥我們就接著開始訓練吧！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果真的把廚房的馬鈴薯用光了......鑄鐵小姐說去找點別的食材......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點累了......想睡覺......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行不行，不能辜負鑄鐵小姐的心意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在才剛剛學會了給馬鈴薯削皮而已，怎麼可以偷懶呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼啊......可是下午的陽光，好舒服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點睏了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就休息一小會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，醒醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真虧你還睡得著啊。不過也好，離出發還有點時間，儘量保留體力吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，那邊那個，接著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是罐頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有罐頭吃就不錯了，知道在荒野上丟了物資的雇傭兵是什麼下場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "筋疲力盡地倒在荒野上，食腐的源石蟲會把你當成屍體，從腿部開始啃你的衣服。等它開始吃你的肉的時候，你還是清醒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，說起來，想吃炭烤沙蟲腿了，最好是現烤的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*哥倫比亞粗口*，別做夢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，就不能烤點肉？燒鍋湯也行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是荒野，又沒有風，點火不小心弄出煙來，好幾公里外都看得見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就相當於對附近所有雇傭兵宣佈“這裡可能有商隊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這次負責護送貨物，暴露行蹤是大忌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘還挺老練。看你年紀不大，這第幾次出來跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "數不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了詐騙和人口販賣，什麼都幹過。論入行時間，可能比你還早點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，口氣不小。你又是怎麼知道我是什麼時候入行的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的刀是雷神工業去年的設計，用的是新材料，重量是前代的一半。你掛刀的腰帶上也沒什麼磨損，應該是從來沒有用過別的刀吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好傢伙，還真是行家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實話說，我也是家裡的農田被天災毀了才出來幹這個的。要不是沒地種，誰願意幹把腦袋別褲腰帶上的營生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，但別看我入行時間短，還從來沒有失手過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一會遇上劫貨的，就讓你們瞧瞧我的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸，別說晦氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開玩笑開玩笑......這次保密可是做得夠好的，臨出發前才把路線圖交到我們手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是常用的保密方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的雇主會事先準備多個路線圖，全部密封起來。臨出發時再由中間人隨機挑選一張地圖交到傭兵手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傭兵接到地圖時，要是看到密封條有被打開過的痕跡，就可以拒絕出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣可以避免傭兵和雇主直接聯絡，也排除了洩密的可能。這次的雇主倒是專業的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好傢伙，這些箱子裡裝的到底是什麼東西，值得這樣小題大做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只管把貨物交到指定的地方，領錢走人就是。別的也管不著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的也是。不過這次給的不少，箱子裡肯定是更值錢的東西吧！感覺自己身價都高貴了不少，哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一拿到錢，我就在鎮上找個酒吧，先醉個一天一夜再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的活再多接幾單，我就可以去南邊再買一塊地，還可以再開一個啤酒農場，哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們呢？拿到錢準備幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可沒你那興致，先找家武器鋪保養我的弩才是正事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個小姑娘，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "買個新髮飾吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗——你說啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前的髮飾弄丟了，前面的頭髮會擋住眼睛，好煩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗哈哈哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底有什麼好笑的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有我們兩個活下來了嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵人的進攻顯然是有預謀的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然不知道具體發生了什麼，但一定是有人故意把我們的位置暴露出去了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要幹什麼？別再管貨物了，我們已經暴露了，遲早會有更多人找上來的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任務已經失敗了！趕緊去前面的城鎮想辦法處理你的傷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看我脖子上這個源石結晶，我還能有命嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經是要死的人了！我他媽就想要看看，我到底是為什麼東西死的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒有必要這樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......哈哈......哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空的，裡面是空的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們他媽的從一開始就是誘餌，那筆錢，就是用來買我們命的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真蠢，怎麼就相信了別人的鬼話，說什麼當雇傭兵隨隨便便就能賺到花不完的錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈......可不是嘛，只要死得夠早，就用不到錢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都該死！雇傭兵全部都該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂喂，刻刀？醒醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！抱歉，我剛好像睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近的訓練確實有些辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不管怎麼說，現在可是驗收這一個月來刻苦訓練的成果的時候，要精神點啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（緊張地吞咽口水）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小心翼翼地揭開鍋蓋）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於......完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔喔！看起來還不錯嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刻刀，我就知道你可以的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝鑄鐵小姐的幫助，只靠我一個人的話，肯定是不行的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說那麼多啦，快讓我嘗嘗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請，請稍等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是讓我自己先嘗嘗吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咀嚼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是很好吃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？讓我嘗嘗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明很好吃啊！刻刀你也太謙虛了吧！如果不知道的話，說是角峰大哥做的我都信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑄鐵小姐過譽啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對不對，應該說很有刻刀的特色！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說“結業料理”打算做“沙蟲罐頭燴飯”的時候我還嚇了一跳，我真的沒有想到會這麼好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本罐頭裡過重的調料味被米飯中和了，沙蟲肉經過重新加工後口感也變好了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，加進來的馬鈴薯泥也可謂神來之筆！我覺得可以考慮把這道菜列入羅德島食堂食譜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為想到鑄鐵小姐說過的，“要把熟悉的食材做成自己期待的樣子”，想來想去，自己熟悉的食物只有沙蟲罐頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說明你已經掌握烹飪技術的精髓啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我也只會做這一道菜啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鑄鐵",
      "speakerId": "char_333_sidero",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是第一道菜，也是一個全新的開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻刀",
      "speakerId": "char_301_cutter",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是完成任務，是要帶著希望......做成自己期待的樣子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
